# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. A set commit re-filters the hosted members
# for its write fence but swaps every shadow the prepare cached, so a member
# that stopped being replicated since prepare is cut over under peer authority
# and outside the fence.
MODULE: PeerRestoreCommitSwapsEveryCachedShadow
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a commit swaps every cached shadow, including a tree it no longer hosts
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
        sw == IF cached THEN cache \cap t ELSE t
--- REPLACE
        sw == IF cached THEN cache ELSE t
--- END
